# Release Manifest — v0.3.0 RC3

| Path | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `.nojekyll` | Prevents GitHub Pages/Jekyll processing. |
| `index.html` | App shell, five views, mode-aware Adventure structure, dialogs, and navigation. |
| `styles.css` | Mobile/iPad layouts, distinct modes, assignment response panels, and Memories response styling. |
| `road-data.js` | Public itinerary, two complete experience packs, structured response fields, and stable fact IDs. |
| `app.js` | State, rendering, assignment/fact responses, journals, observations, stays, backup, updates, and migration. |
| `service-worker.js` | RC3 offline shell cache and old-version cleanup. |
| `manifest.webmanifest` | PWA identity and icons. |
| `release-manifest.json` | Published-version check. |
| `icons/` | App, maskable, Apple touch, favicon, and source SVG icons. |
| `README.md` | Project overview. |
| `RELEASE_NOTES.md` | RC3 assignment-response scope. |
| `CHANGELOG.md` | Version history. |
| `KNOWN_ISSUES.md` | Current limits and deferred capabilities. |
| `TESTING_CHECKLIST.md` | Device and RC3 acceptance tests. |
| `GITHUB_BROWSER_UPDATE.md` | Computer/browser deployment procedure. |
| `WORKING_COPY_UPDATE.md` | iPhone/iPad deployment procedure. |
| `TEST_REPORT.md` | Test evidence for this package. |
| `start-local.sh` / `start-local.bat` | Local static server helpers. |
